      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "We will have to establish a few things while we read. First, we should establish who the author is. The author never outright says who he is in any of the chapters here. The conclusion that most scholars have come to is that it was Solomon, and I tend to agree for a few reasons. We will go through that as we read, but we can rightfully determine it’s Solomon based on the amount of wisdom that is going to be poured out in these pages.",
