      "endVerse": 2,
      "author": "Tried By Fire",
      "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
      "text": "Now we stop for a second, and you say, “This doesn’t sound like Jesus Christ. This sounds sad already!” Is this a message of Christ? To this very lost and calloused world, yes! We cling onto this world with everything we’ve got, but the Lord (and the Preacher, capital “P” by the way) will tell you that nothing in this world is actually valuable. It all will go away.",
