          "startVerse": 1,
          "endVerse": 1,
          "author": "Tried By Fire",
          "authorHandle": "@TriedByFire",
          "text": "Next, he calls himself “the son of David.” Now we could reference quite a few people as “David’s” sons. Thankfully, the Bible gives us quite a few genealogies to be sure our information is correct:",
